      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I hope there's some progress on this! With the recent release of DLSS 4 in 2025 this year, I feel this can greatly benefit the experience of users who are in large instances or are on lower-end systems and need those extra frames for better performance.\n\nThis may be the answer to increasing player retention on the platform because VRChat can be a very graphically intensive application at times. Of course, this mainly benefits PC users over Quest players so developers still need to optimize their content properly. But I believe it's a step in the right direction in terms of quality of life performance improvements.",
